    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/aacac3fa5de7a8259eb349b7e8b03439.avif?t=1752666365\" width=616 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frozen Ship is a first-person narrative adventure in the unique blending of survival, build&amp;craft, and economic strategy genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the snow-covered wastelands of a once-thriving world. You will lead an expedition to find a place suitable for establishing a settlement. At your disposal is a crew of 20 people and a ship \u00ad- a machine capable of covering vast distances while carrying everything necessary for a long journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/a57f3076dfa56c04be5905c76acc84ff.avif?t=1752666365\" width=616 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/098509750fc21c5a2c28fa50755f403e.avif?t=1752666365\" width=616 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/b30e1b25d10ea48d278fd3be82ecb38b.avif?t=1752666365\" width=616 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/516c49a9cf0e17ff4cf710a1654715e9.avif?t=1752666365\" width=616 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423990/extras/0abab32f483ea1fcb17fc04a2582f2e7.avif?t=1752666365